stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> RECEIVED: solicitud válida
  RECEIVED --> QUEUED: encolada por prioridad
  QUEUED --> SENDING: worker toma el trabajo
  SENDING --> SENT: proveedor acepta
  SENDING --> RETRYING: error transitorio
  RETRYING --> SENDING: tras backoff
  RETRYING --> FALLBACK: reintentos agotados
  SENDING --> FALLBACK: error permanente o circuito abierto
  FALLBACK --> SENDING: siguiente canal o proveedor
  FALLBACK --> FAILED: sin alternativas
  SENT --> DELIVERED: confirmación del proveedor
  SENT --> [*]
  DELIVERED --> [*]
  FAILED --> [*]
